fonts-patroneos (1.1.0) resolute; urgency=medium

  * PatroneOS's fonts 1.1.0, from their release: PatroneOS Sans is redrawn,
    with new letter shapes, proportions and spacing, narrower letters, a
    single-storey g and a heavier Bold. Mono, Document, Serif and Classic
    keep their glyphs.

