fonts-patroneos (1.0.0) resolute; urgency=medium

  * PatroneOS's fonts 1.0.0, from their release: PatroneOS Sans, Mono,
    Document, Serif and Classic, 28 static fonts. They take over from Patrone
    Sans (fonts-patrone-sans, now a transitional package that installs
